---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About the Seishinkan Yamamoto Records Storage"
  description="Introducing the history of the former Seishinkan Yamamoto Training Center, once located in Atsubetsu-cho Yamamoto, Atsubetsu-ku, and how it now serves as a records storage facility."
  lang="en"
  path="/en/dojo/yamamoto/"
>
  <section class="dojo-list">
    <div class="page-container">
      <div class="section__title-area">
        <span class="section-label">ARCHIVE</span>
        <h1 class="section-title">Seishinkan Yamamoto Records Storage</h1>
      </div>

      <p class="detail-page__lead">
        The Seishinkan Yamamoto Training Center was established in May 2014 (Heisei 26) by converting a warehouse into a space where meetings and training sessions could be held, and where visitors from regional branches or overseas could stay in simple lodging.<br />
        Originally it also had space set aside for practice, but the lodging function has since moved to the <a
          href="/en/dojo/hondori/">Hondori Seishinkan</a
        >, and this location now serves as a storage facility for records and materials.
      </p>

      <div class="detail-gallery">
        <figure>
          <img
            src="/assets/images/legacy/dojo/yamamoto/DSC_2408.jpg"
            alt="Records storage room"
            width="320"
            height="240"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <figcaption>Records storage room</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <img
            src="/assets/images/legacy/dojo/yamamoto/Image7.jpg"
            alt="Records storage room"
            width="336"
            height="241"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <figcaption>Records storage room</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>

      <h2 class="detail-page__heading">
        Former Seishinkan Yamamoto Training Center (Atsubetsu-cho Yamamoto, Atsubetsu-ku, Sapporo)
      </h2>
      <div class="detail-gallery">
        <figure>
          <img
            src="/assets/images/legacy/dojo/yamamoto/img7.jpg"
            alt="Exterior of the former Seishinkan Yamamoto Training Center"
            width="314"
            height="208"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <figcaption>Exterior</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <img
            src="/assets/images/legacy/dojo/yamamoto/MVC-466X.jpg"
            alt="Exterior of the former Seishinkan Yamamoto Training Center"
            width="301"
            height="202"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <figcaption>Exterior</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <img
            src="/assets/images/legacy/dojo/yamamoto/img4.jpg"
            alt="Members' get-together — yakiniku party"
            width="309"
            height="235"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <figcaption>Members' get-together — yakiniku party</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <img
            src="/assets/images/legacy/dojo/yamamoto/img5.jpg"
            alt="Members' get-together — yakiniku party"
            width="302"
            height="226"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <figcaption>Members' get-together — yakiniku party</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>

      <h2 class="detail-page__heading">Seishinkan Yamamoto Training Facility</h2>
      <p>Site area: 200 tsubo / Floor area: 120 tsubo</p>
      <div class="detail-gallery">
        <figure>
          <img
            src="/assets/images/legacy/dojo/yamamoto/DSC_0005.jpg"
            alt="Seishinkan Yamamoto Training Facility"
            width="248"
            height="161"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <img
            src="/assets/images/legacy/dojo/yamamoto/Image4.jpg"
            alt="Reception room"
            width="245"
            height="167"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <figcaption>Reception</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>

      <h2 class="detail-page__heading">Memorial Room of the Late Director Kayoko Mimura</h2>
      <p>Personal items from that time are kept here.</p>
      <div class="detail-gallery">
        <figure>
          <img
            src="/assets/images/legacy/dojo/yamamoto/img3.jpg"
            alt="Memorial Room of the late Director Kayoko Mimura"
            width="232"
            height="153"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <img
            src="/assets/images/legacy/dojo/yamamoto/Image1.jpg"
            alt="Memorial Room of the late Director Kayoko Mimura"
            width="209"
            height="153"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </figure>
      </div>

      <p class="detail-page__note">
        ※This facility is used for meetings and storage, and no classes are held here. For training days and venues, please see the <a
          href="/en/dojo/atsubetsu/">list of Karate Dojos & Classes in Atsubetsu Ward</a
        >.
      </p>

      <p class="detail-page__back">
        <a href="/en/dojo/atsubetsu/">← Back to Karate Dojos & Classes in Atsubetsu Ward</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
